---
// Contact CTA - ballaholic style: bold CTA card
---

<section class="contact section" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact__card card card--dark fade-up">
      <div class="contact__inner">
        <span class="section-label" style="color: #FF5E1A;">Contact</span>
        <h2 class="contact__title">
          まずは無料体験から<br />
          始めてみませんか？
        </h2>
        <p class="contact__text">
          見学・体験ともに無料です。お気軽にお問い合わせください。<br />
          動きやすい服装でお越しいただければ手ぶらで参加いただけます。
        </p>
        <div class="contact__actions">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tshr_jiujitsu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--primary">
            Instagram でお問い合わせ
            <svg class="btn__arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/304416070927536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--outline" style="color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">
            Facebook グループ
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: #F5F2EE;
  }

  .contact__card {
    padding: 80px 60px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #1A1A1A;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .contact__card .btn--primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 60px;
    background: #FF5E1A;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.35s ease;
  }

  .contact__card .btn--primary:hover {
    background: #E04A0A;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(255, 94, 26, 0.3);
  }

  .contact__card .btn--outline {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 60px;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.35s ease;
  }

  .contact__inner {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .contact__title {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .contact__text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    line-height: 2;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .contact__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact__card { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .contact__actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }
</style>
